---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Captio — intake · portafolio · equipo"
  description="Captio convierte el primer contacto con un cliente en un proceso estructurado. El cliente llena el formulario. La IA genera el portafolio. El abogado llega listo."
  activePage="home"
>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     HERO
═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-center pt-20 pb-16 px-6 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="absolute -top-40 -right-40 w-[700px] h-[700px] rounded-full bg-[#3B6FE8]/6 blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 -left-40 w-[500px] h-[500px] rounded-full bg-[#1B2E5E]/5 blur-3xl"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full relative">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[2fr_3fr] gap-16 items-center">

      <div>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#EEF1F8] text-[#3B6FE8] text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-7 fade-up">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#3B6FE8] animate-pulse"></span>
          <span class="t-es">intake · portafolio · equipo</span>
          <span class="t-en">intake · brief · team</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-black tracking-[-0.04em] text-[#1B2E5E] leading-[1.05] mb-6 fade-up d1">
          <span class="t-es">El cliente llena.<br>El abogado<br><span class="text-[#3B6FE8]">llega listo.</span></span>
          <span class="t-en">Client fills.<br>Lawyer arrives<br><span class="text-[#3B6FE8]">prepared.</span></span>
        </h1>

        <p class="text-lg text-[#6B7694] leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-md fade-up d2">
          <span class="t-es">Captio convierte el primer contacto con un cliente en un proceso estructurado que termina con un resumen de IA listo para el abogado — antes de la primera llamada.</span>
          <span class="t-en">Captio turns the first client contact into a structured process that ends with an AI-generated summary ready for the lawyer — before the first call.</span>
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 fade-up d3">
          <a href="/pricing/#trial" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#3B6FE8] hover:bg-[#2d5fd4] text-white font-bold px-7 py-3.5 rounded-xl transition-all hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#3B6FE8]/30 text-base">
            <span class="t-es">Solicitar acceso</span>
            <span class="t-en">Request access</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="#how-it-works" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[#1B2E5E] font-semibold px-7 py-3.5 rounded-xl border border-[#d4daf0] hover:bg-white hover:border-[#3B6FE8]/40 transition-all text-base">
            <span class="t-es">Ver cómo funciona</span>
            <span class="t-en">See how it works</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-[#A0A8BF] fade-up d4">
          <span class="t-es">Desde $700 / mes · Hasta 15 usuarios</span>
          <span class="t-en">From $40 / month · Up to 15 users</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Dashboard screenshot -->
      <div class="hidden lg:block fade-up d2">
        <div class="relative img-float">
          <div class="absolute inset-4 bg-[#3B6FE8]/12 rounded-3xl blur-2xl"></div>
          <div class="relative t-es">
            <img
              src="https://res.cloudinary.com/do144qmdb/image/upload/v1780953979/captio/es/tutorial_bl6jrx.webp"
              alt="Captio — historial de clientes"
              class="w-full rounded-2xl border-4 border-white shadow-2xl shadow-[#1B2E5E]/30 ring-1 ring-[#d4daf0]"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="relative t-en">
            <img
              src="https://res.cloudinary.com/do144qmdb/image/upload/v1780959549/captio/en/tutorial_lytudg.webp"
              alt="Captio — client history"
              class="w-full rounded-2xl border-4 border-white shadow-2xl shadow-[#1B2E5E]/30 ring-1 ring-[#d4daf0]"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     PROBLEM
═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="py-20 px-6 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#1B2E5E] mb-4">
        <span class="t-es">El primer contacto cuesta tiempo<br class="hidden sm:block"> que no tienes</span>
        <span class="t-en">The first contact costs time<br class="hidden sm:block"> you don't have</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[#6B7694] text-lg max-w-xl mx-auto">
        <span class="t-es">La mayoría de los despachos improvisan el intake. Captio lo estructura.</span>
        <span class="t-en">Most firms improvise the intake. Captio structures it.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">

      <div class="bg-[#FFF8F8] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-[#FECACA]/50">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#EF4444]/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#EF4444]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1B2E5E] mb-2 text-[15px]">
          <span class="t-es">No más primera llamada perdida en preguntas básicas</span>
          <span class="t-en">No more first call lost on basic questions</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[#6B7694] text-sm leading-relaxed">
          <span class="t-es">El abogado llega sin contexto. Los primeros 20 minutos son de recopilación — no de estrategia.</span>
          <span class="t-en">The lawyer arrives with no context. The first 20 minutes are about gathering data — not strategy.</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#FFF8F8] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-[#FECACA]/50">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#EF4444]/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#EF4444]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 6h16M4 10h16M4 14h10M4 18h6"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1B2E5E] mb-2 text-[15px]">
          <span class="t-es">No más casos dispersos en correos, notas y WhatsApp</span>
          <span class="t-en">No more cases scattered across emails, notes, and WhatsApp</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[#6B7694] text-sm leading-relaxed">
          <span class="t-es">Sin un lugar único, delegar un caso significa que el colega empieza de cero.</span>
          <span class="t-en">Without a single source of truth, delegating a case means your colleague starts from scratch.</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#FFF8F8] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-[#FECACA]/50">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#EF4444]/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#EF4444]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 001.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 001.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 00-3.42 0z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1B2E5E] mb-2 text-[15px]">
          <span class="t-es">No más conflicto de interés revisado a mano — o no revisado</span>
          <span class="t-en">No more conflict of interest checked manually — or not at all</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[#6B7694] text-sm leading-relaxed">
          <span class="t-es">Sin un proceso formal, la verificación depende de la memoria. Un riesgo innecesario.</span>
          <span class="t-en">Without a formal process, conflict checking depends on memory. An unnecessary risk.</span>
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     HOW IT WORKS
═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section id="how-it-works" class="py-20 px-6 bg-[#F8F9FC]">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-14">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#1B2E5E] mb-4">
        <span class="t-es">Del formulario al portafolio en minutos</span>
        <span class="t-en">From form to brief in minutes</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[#6B7694] text-lg">
        <span class="t-es">Sin trabajo manual. Sin sorpresas.</span>
        <span class="t-en">No manual work. No surprises.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">

      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="w-20 h-20 mx-auto rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#3B6FE8] to-[#1B2E5E] flex items-center justify-center mb-5 shadow-lg shadow-[#3B6FE8]/30 relative">
          <span class="absolute -top-2 -right-2 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-white border-2 border-[#3B6FE8] text-[#3B6FE8] text-xs font-black flex items-center justify-center">1</span>
          <svg class="w-9 h-9 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M13.828 10.172a4 4 0 00-5.656 0l-4 4a4 4 0 105.656 5.656l1.102-1.101m-.758-4.899a4 4 0 005.656 0l4-4a4 4 0 00-5.656-5.656l-1.1 1.1"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1B2E5E] text-lg mb-2">
          <span class="t-es">Genera el enlace</span>
          <span class="t-en">Generate the link</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[#6B7694] text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xs mx-auto">
          <span class="t-es">Un clic. Captio genera un enlace único. Envíalo por correo, WhatsApp o SMS. El cliente lo abre sin cuenta ni app.</span>
          <span class="t-en">One click. Captio generates a unique link. Send it by email, WhatsApp, or SMS. Client opens it with no account or app.</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="w-20 h-20 mx-auto rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#3B6FE8] to-[#1B2E5E] flex items-center justify-center mb-5 shadow-lg shadow-[#3B6FE8]/30 relative">
          <span class="absolute -top-2 -right-2 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-white border-2 border-[#3B6FE8] text-[#3B6FE8] text-xs font-black flex items-center justify-center">2</span>
          <svg class="w-9 h-9 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1B2E5E] text-lg mb-2">
          <span class="t-es">El cliente llena el formulario</span>
          <span class="t-en">Client fills the form</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[#6B7694] text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xs mx-auto">
          <span class="t-es">6 secciones estructuradas: caso, objetivos, documentos, partes. En su idioma, a su ritmo, desde cualquier dispositivo.</span>
          <span class="t-en">6 structured sections: case, goals, documents, parties. In their language, at their pace, from any device.</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="w-20 h-20 mx-auto rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#3B6FE8] to-[#1B2E5E] flex items-center justify-center mb-5 shadow-lg shadow-[#3B6FE8]/30 relative">
          <span class="absolute -top-2 -right-2 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-white border-2 border-[#3B6FE8] text-[#3B6FE8] text-xs font-black flex items-center justify-center">3</span>
          <svg class="w-9 h-9 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1B2E5E] text-lg mb-2">
          <span class="t-es">Portafolio listo en segundos</span>
          <span class="t-en">Brief ready in seconds</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[#6B7694] text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xs mx-auto">
          <span class="t-es">La IA genera un portafolio de 10 secciones — puntos clave, riesgos, conflicto de interés y más. El abogado lee, edita, resalta y descarga.</span>
          <span class="t-en">AI generates a 10-section brief — key points, risks, conflict of interest, and more. The lawyer reads, edits, highlights, and downloads.</span>
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-[#EEF1F8] p-7 shadow-sm">
      <p class="text-xs font-bold text-[#A0A8BF] uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">
        <span class="t-es">Las 10 secciones del portafolio</span>
        <span class="t-en">The 10 brief sections</span>
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        {[
          ['1', 'Puntos clave',         'Key points'],
          ['2', 'Versión del cliente',   "Client's version"],
          ['3', 'Resumen del caso',      'Case summary'],
          ['4', 'Objetivos y resultado', 'Goals and outcome'],
          ['5', 'Información de apoyo',  'Supporting information'],
          ['6', 'Conflicto de interés',  'Conflict of interest'],
          ['7', 'Riesgos clave',         'Key risks'],
          ['8', 'Información pendiente', 'Missing information'],
          ['9', 'Consideraciones legales','Legal considerations'],
          ['10','Encabezado',            'Header'],
        ].map(([n, es, en]) => (
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-[#F8F9FC] border border-[#EEF1F8] rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-[#1A1F36] font-medium">
            <span class="text-[#3B6FE8] font-bold text-xs">{n}</span>
            <span class="t-es">{es}</span>
            <span class="t-en">{en}</span>
          </span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     FEATURES
═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section id="features" class="py-20 px-6 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#1B2E5E] mb-4">
        <span class="t-es">Todo lo que el despacho necesita</span>
        <span class="t-en">Everything the firm needs</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[#6B7694] text-lg max-w-xl mx-auto">
        <span class="t-es">Desde el primer contacto hasta las notas del caso — en un solo lugar.</span>
        <span class="t-en">From the first contact to case notes — in one place.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
      {[
        {
          icon: 'M13.828 10.172a4 4 0 00-5.656 0l-4 4a4 4 0 105.656 5.656l1.102-1.101m-.758-4.899a4 4 0 005.656 0l4-4a4 4 0 00-5.656-5.656l-1.1 1.1',
          es: 'Enlace de intake',
          en: 'Intake link',
          descEs: 'Genera un enlace único por cliente en un clic. Sin cuentas, sin fricción. Cualquier miembro del equipo puede enviarlo.',
          descEn: 'Generate a unique link per client in one click. No accounts, no friction. Any team member can send it.',
        },
        {
          icon: 'M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4',
